":223,"surface":"齊、宋、衞、鄭、曹、許君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0224","start":224,"end":225,"surface":"會","kind":"person","person_id":"wt0_abc_2sk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0225","start":225,"end":227,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"dm0_58v_50i_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0233","start":233,"end":235,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"jmz_qgu_bq0","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p134","text":"哀公大父雍，晉昭公少子也，號爲戴子。戴子生忌。忌善知伯，蚤死，故知伯欲盡并晉，未敢，乃立忌子驕爲君。當是時，晉國政皆決知伯，晉哀公不得有所制。知伯遂有范、中行地，最彊。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"哀公","kind":"person","person_id":"0ad_dbw_97q_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"雍","kind":"person","person_id":"0ad_dbw_97q_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"0ad_dbw_97q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"戴子","kind":"person","person_id":"0ad_dbw_97q_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"戴子","kind":"person","person_id":"0ad_dbw_97q_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"忌","kind":"person","person_id":"0ad_dbw_97q_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"忌","kind":"person","person_id":"0ad_dbw_97q_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m134-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"知伯",